// Wields a weapon, brings up the weapon bar (as a number key does) and then
// the main menu over the game (as escape does), screenshotting each: the
// weapon bar, the weapon HUD and anything else of the game's must not show
// through the menu.
// The menu pauses the game, so the menu's shots and the quit are chained in
// one client command line with frame waits.
// Both games, shots paired: .claude\skills\retail-capture\scripts\capture.ps1 -Probe probe-menu -Map training
probe:
waitforplayer
wait 25
stuffcmd "give weapon_shotgun.tik"
stuffcmd "give weapon_sword.tik"
wait 0.5
stuffcmd "use Shotgun dual"
wait 3
stuffcmd "warpinv guns"
wait 0.5
stuffcmd "screenshot"
wait 0.5
stuffcmd "pushmenu main; wait 100; screenshot; wait 3000; screenshot; wait 8000; screenshot; wait 100; quit"
end
